    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I check a makeup artist name is free?",
        "answer": "Press Check on any name to see whether it's free as a company, a domain and a social media handle. In the UK, also search Companies House; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. Check your local area too, as another business nearby with a similar name can confuse clients."
      },
      {
        "question": "What should I call my makeup artist Instagram?",
        "answer": "Use the same name as your business, so clients can find you everywhere. \"Makeup by Sarah\" or \"Sarah Hartley Makeup\" tells people who you are and what you do, and adding your town (\"Hampton Bridal Makeup\") helps local brides find you. Keep it short, avoid numbers and extra underscores, and check the handle is free on every platform before you print anything."
      }
    ]
